    "longDescription": "Regain control over your data.\n\nThe Nextcloud app for Android brings your photos and files with you wherever you go!\n\n- Connect one or multiple accounts to your private or business cloud.\n- Access, work on and share documents wherever you are.\n- Upload your photos and videos to your Nextcloud to save space on your phone.\n- Browse photos and videos stored on your private cloud.\n- Choose files to keep available even when you're offline.\n- Additional features:\n  - Auto-upload\n  - AI Assistant\n  - Protect your account with a password or Biometrics\n  - Support for end-to-end encryption\n\nNew to Nextcloud? Nextcloud is a collaboration platform designed for private clouds. Host it yourself or with a company you trust and you gain a complete digital workplace with online office document collaboration, video calls and chat, email, calendar and project management, a local AI assistant and much more.\n\nSee https://nextcloud.com/hub to find out what Nextcloud can do for you!\n\nFor discussions and reporting issues please go to https://help.nextcloud.com/c/clients/android",
